<rss version="2.0" xmlns:slash="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/"><channel><title>VnExpress English</title><description>VnExpress English RSS</description><image><url>https://s.vnecdn.net/english/i/v28/graphics/vne_international.svg</url><title>VnExpress English</title><link>https://e.vnexpress.net</link></image><link>https://e.vnexpress.net/rss/business.rss</link><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 09:15:44 +0700</pubDate><generator>VnExpress</generator><item><title>Thailand bears Southeast Asia's second heaviest economic cost from air pollution, behind Indonesia</title><description><![CDATA[<a href="https://e.vnexpress.net/news/business/economy/thailand-bears-southeast-asia-s-second-heaviest-economic-cost-from-air-pollution-behind-indonesia-5123815.html"><img src="https://i1-english.vnecdn.net/2026/09/23/LYETHIDGSZOYPJWOB7O4JFK5HI1777-7167-9543-1790150568.webp?w=900&h=0&q=100&dpr=1&fit=crop&s=Dn2YJDL65BQn0NjGKHrx6A" ></a></br>PM2.5 air pollution costs the Thai economy an estimated US$45.3 billion annually, or 3.89% of its GDP, the second-highest figure in Southeast Asia behind Indonesia's, per a World Bank assessment.]]></description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 05:00:00 +0700</pubDate><link>https://e.vnexpress.net/news/business/economy/thailand-bears-southeast-asia-s-second-heaviest-economic-cost-from-air-pollution-behind-indonesia-5123815.html</link><guid>https://e.vnexpress.net/news/business/economy/thailand-bears-southeast-asia-s-second-heaviest-economic-cost-from-air-pollution-behind-indonesia-5123815.html</guid></item><item><title>VinSpeed of Southeast Asia's richest man Pham Nhat Vuong signs $1.1B deal with German rail giant Siemens Mobility</title><description><![CDATA[<a href="https://e.vnexpress.net/news/business/companies/vinspeed-of-southeast-asia-s-richest-man-pham-nhat-vuong-signs-1-1b-deal-with-german-rail-giant-siemens-mobility-5123623.html"><img src="https://i1-english.vnecdn.net/2026/09/23/download-jfif-1790129554-6980-1790145819.jpg?w=900&h=0&q=100&dpr